item.description:
Listen to audiobook in full for free : <br><a href="https://amzn.to/4hopIfn">https://amzn.to/4hopIfn</a> <br><br>Title: Wanting Doesn’t Guarantee Having [Russian Edition]: Why Your Dreams Don’t Materialize and How to Fix It<br>Author: Daniel Harris<br>Narrator: Daniil Teplov<br>Length: 2:29:41<br>Release date: 07-15-2025<br>Publisher: Authors Republic<br>Genres: Self Development, Health & Wellness, Mindfulness & Meditation<br>Language: English<br><br>Description:<br>A book that can change your life. But only if you're ready to hear why it hasn't changed yet.
Before you lies the candid story of a British designer who spent five years on popular 'wish fulfillment' techniques and ended up empty-handed. Divorce, career dead-end, complete disillusionment with the power of thought — it seemed like a road to nowhere. Until a chance encounter in a London bookstore turned all his ideas about how the connection between thoughts and reality actually works upside down.
By listening to this audiobook, you will learn:
• Why mechanically repeating 'I am rich and successful' only reinforces internal blocks;
• What the critical difference is between desire (which repels) and intention (which attracts);
• How to identify and rewrite the internal beliefs that hinder any change;
• Why 70% of your energy is wasted and how to stop it;
• What the secret of proper visualization is;
• How to read the signs of the Universe without becoming a superstitious paranoid;
• How to use the 'inspired action' formula that delivers tangible results.
If you're looking for a magic pill or secret mantra for instant success — this audiobook is not for you. But if you're ready to learn why your desires aren't being fulfilled and what to do about it — welcome to an honest conversation about the power of thought.
The time has come to take the right tools and create the life you don't just want, but are truly ready to live!<br><br>#ad Disclosure: As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.

